   "id": "af9cef32-32f4-4a26-b5f7-20b2e62fd83b",
   "term": "Mic Level",
   "verdict": "MINOR",
   "suggestions": [
    {
     "field": "definition",
     "severity": "Low",
     "issue": "Line level is given as '(-10 to +4 dBu)'. The -10 figure is the consumer line-level reference, which is -10 dBV (not dBu); +4 is the professional reference in dBu. Labelling both as dBu mixes two different reference units. (Basic, well-established audio unit distinction; no source needed.)",
     "suggestion": "Change to 'line level (-10 dBV consumer to +4 dBu professional)'."
